/P 296 0 R
/E (The agenda is built on the understanding that the right to mobility, work, and participation are inseparable. Without freedom of movement, women cannot study or work. Without employment, they lack independence. Without political power, they cannot influence change. These three freedoms together represent the foundation of equality. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
