/P 296 0 R
/E (This agenda challenges delegates to think beyond sympathy and focus on solutions, reforms that balance cultural contexts with universal human rights. It calls for policies that not only protect women but empower them to move, work, and govern on their own terms. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
